    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Granted by @UUID[Compendium.astillon-hanaq-adventures-module.astillon-blaster-items.Item.BlasterAuraIns01]{Inspire Aura}</p>\n<p>Its summoning Blaster gains a +1 untyped bonus to attack rolls, damage rolls, and saves against fear while inside this thrall's 60-foot aura. Bonuses from distinct thralls stack; one thrall never supplies multiple copies of its own benefit.</p>\n<p>The benefit ends on leaving the aura, changing this thrall's mode, or the thrall's destruction, removal, or expiration.</p>",
